Eli gama likaYesu Liyathandeka kuthi; Phezulu bathemba lona Nathi sithemba lona.

Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje; Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje;

Alikho igam’ elihle, Livuyis’ intliziyo; Alikho igam’ elinje, Ngegama likaYesu.

Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje; Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje;

Ndiyathemba ndakumbona Xa aphuthum’ abaKhe; Ndiyathemba ndakumbona Ndivuye emoyeni.

Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje; Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje;

Ndakusebenza noYesu Entsimini kaThixo; Koba kuhle xa uYesu Andisikelelayo.

Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje; Gam’ e . . . lihle, Alikho igam’ elinje;

Xa athand’ ukuba ndife, Kuhle ndifele kuYe; Koba kuhle xa uYesu Alithemba lam Yena.

